    "Detach this quote" : "Desvincular esta cita",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Desvincular avisa al otro servidor, que entonces muestra la cita como retirada. La entrada en sí es suya y se queda donde está.",
